/target
# Library crate — lockfile is excluded so downstream resolution wins.
/Cargo.lock
# Per-agent worktrees created by Claude Code's parallel-agent tooling.
/.claude/
docs/local/
web/*.wasm
# Conformance corpora, fetched by scripts/fetch-testdata.sh. Never committed:
# several suites are copyleft or unlicensed, and running one as an emulated
# guest is ordinary use while shipping it here is redistribution.
# docs/testing/conformance-suites.md has the verified licence table.
/testdata/
